      <p source="#source-532-945"><seg source="#source-532-565">此度出崎仕候上ハ、御存</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-565-616" corresp="#source-574-616"><seg source="#source-565-574">（知）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-616-703">の事件ニ候間、万一の御報知仕候時ハ、愚妻儀本国ニ送り返し可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-703-715">レ</note><seg source="#source-715-835">申、然レバ国本より家僕及老婆壱人、御家まで参上仕候。其間愚妻おして尊家に御養置可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-835-847">レ</note><seg source="#source-847-850">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-850-862">レ</note><seg source="#source-862-880">遣候よふ、万</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-880-913">〻</g><seg source="#source-913-945">御頼申上候。拝稽首。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-945-1004" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-966-1004"><seg source="#source-966-978">五月八日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-978-1004" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-996-1004">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
