      <div type="layout" source="#source-1065-1133" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1086-1133"><seg source="#source-1086-1101">三吉慎蔵様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1101-1133" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1119-1133">坂本龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1133-1165" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
